-hh-simple</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"76356b50167415cf\" href=\"?note=76356b50167415cf\" title=\"20-df-hypersimple\">20-df-hypersimple</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"428fc565e7338639\" href=\"?note=428fc565e7338639\" title=\"20-df-simple\">20-df-simple</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"063b60d9acc5d2bd\" href=\"?note=063b60d9acc5d2bd\" title=\"20-df-d-simple\">20-df-d-simple</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"511b2c0cef24bfb9\" href=\"?note=511b2c0cef24bfb9\" title=\"20-thm-d-simple-implies-simple\">20-thm-d-simple-implies-simple</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e1683dc500d8b948\" href=\"?note=e1683dc500d8b948\" title=\"20-df-hh-simple\">20-df-hh-simple</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"76356b50167415cf\" href=\"?note=76356b50167415cf\" title=\"20-df-hypersimple\">20-df-hypersimple</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"428fc565e7338639\" href=\"?note=428fc565e7338639\" title=\"20-df-simple\">20-df-simple</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"063b60d9acc5d2bd\" href=\"?note=063b60d9acc5d2bd\" title=\"20-df-d-simple\">20-df-d-simple</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"511b2c0cef24bfb9\" href=\"?note=511b2c0cef24bfb9\" title=\"20-thm-d-simple-implies-simple\">20-thm-d-simple-implies-simple</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}simple\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{HHsimple}(A)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Hypersimple}(A)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Simple}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{HHsimple}(A)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{dSimple}(A)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Simple}(A).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}simple\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{HHsimple}(A)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Hypersimple}(A)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Simple}(A),\\\\\n\\operatorname{HHsimple}(A)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{dSimple}(A)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Simple}(A).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>强数组能统一改编成弱数组，单点 c.e. 数组给出普通免疫；这证明第一行。第二行的首蕴含使用原论文 Proposition 1.3 的 Boolean 上区间刻画。原稿把 d-simple 强行放在 hypersimple 与 simple 之间，没有依据；d-simple 与 hypersimple 并非这样的线性层级。不为本书未证明的严格反向反例附造证明。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 5.3.1 后的蕴含讨论；另参 <a href=\"https://msp.org/pjm/1980/87-1/pjm-v87-n1-p12-s.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Lerman–Soare (1980), Proposition 1.3</a>；印刷页 114；PDF 第 149 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-hh-simple","status":"resolved","id":"e1683dc500d8b948","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-hh-simple]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-hypersimple","status":"resolved","id":"76356b50167415cf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-hypersimple]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-simple","status":"resolved","id":"428fc565e7338639","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-simple]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-d-simple","status":"resolved","id":"063b60d9acc5d2bd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-d-simple]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-d-simple-implies-simple","status":"resolved","id":"511b2c0cef24bfb9","anchor":"ref-